st sending, based on how likely the twin is to make the same choice. Quiet comes out to -5+3q in expected years and sending to -4q, so I'm checking the threshold where quiet becomes the better option.\n\nI'm settling the threshold: quiet wins once q is above 5/7. Since the twin runs the same reasoning on the same setup, I'd expect correlation above that, so I'm choosing to pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through the twin prisoner's dilemma with evidential decision theory, comparing the expected cost of staying quiet against sending, based on how likely the twin is to make the same choice. Quiet comes out to -5+3q in expected years and sending to -4q, so I'm checking the threshold where quiet becomes the better option.\n\nI'm settling the threshold: quiet wins once q is above 5/7. Since the twin runs the same reasoning on the same setup, I'd expect correlation above that, so I'm choosing to pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9648,"completion_tokens":806,"total_tokens":10454,"cost":0.054712,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.054712,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.038592,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01612},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":257,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}